> With the exception of the use of 7 certain candles[1], vegan lifestyle
> would be not using or wearing any animal items.   Armour-wise, this
> should be interesting, the best AK kit I can come up with would be the
> following -- T-shirt, Dwarvish Mithril, a cloak (MR, probably), any helm
